epted value changed.\n- KC3-9 authority for this file: owner decision-01 item 2 only. There are no item 3 (built-in) or Q4 changes here.\n\nLocal instrument additions (all inside values.test.ts):\n- SUMMARIZE: child-side summary of a captureWithWork result.\n- disagreementProbe: one-key descriptor-hook probe.\n- TRAPPING: the child imports harness.ts trapInheritedIndices. It shares the child's Kernel module instances, which the prelude loaded first.\n- An inline full-trap-counting thrown Proxy for the hostile-error case.\n- doublingToByteStop: pre-order unit-table model used for the 2^31 shared-leaf test.\n- workOf, structureBytes, byteStop: helpers for the exact expectations.\n\nSuggestion for capture-instruments.ts: the prelude declares top-level names (counts, tracked, track, hooks, restore, unwrapped, wrap, isTracked, utilTypes, values, kernel, reset, snapshot, emit). A probe body that redeclares one fails with a SyntaxError. I hit this with `tracked`, and it is worth documenting in that file.\n\nCleanup: I removed `type Probe` and the `InheritedIndexTrap` import, which my conversion left unused. The imports that were already unused at B (iteratorNextIsHostile, DescriptorPollution) are left as they were.\n\nNo production change is needed."
